,"docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Split.html#Lean.Meta.Split.mkDiscrGenErrorMsg","kind":"def","line":342,"name":"Lean.Meta.Split.mkDiscrGenErrorMsg","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Split.lean#L342-L343"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Split.html#Lean.Meta.Split.refineMatch\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Split</span>.<span class=\"name\">refineMatch</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">matcherDeclName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">us</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Level.html#Lean.Level\">Level</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">params </span><span class=\"fn\">discrs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Refines a goal into the cases of a matcher applied to `params` and `discrs`, without replacing\nmatcher occurrences in the target. The arguments must be well-typed in the goal's context, but\nthe matcher application need not occur in the target.\n\nComputed discriminants are linked to fresh variables by equalities. After splitting, these\nequalities specialize the goal where possible. Contradictory branches are closed; unresolved\nconditions remain as hypotheses. The target is not simplified.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Split.html#Lean.Meta.Split.refineMatch","kind":"def","line":314,"name":"Lean.Meta.Split.refineMatch","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Split.lean#L314-L340"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Split.html#Lean.Meta.Split.applyMatchSplitter\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Split</span>.<span class=\"name\">applyMatchSplitter</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">matcherDeclName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">us</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Level.html#Lean.Level\">Level</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">params </span><span class=\"fn\">discrs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Split.html#Lean.Meta.Split.applyMatchSplitter","kind":"def",